Z||000000||fryecar||01-12-2000||12:17 PM||||1985 2M4..... Head gasket is leaking, any tips before I dive in?||||reg||8
Z||000001||862M4inCA||01-12-2000||12:21 PM||||Not really, I replaced mine about 6 months back and decided while I was in there to have the head checked for cracks. Good thing I did since it was cracked in something like 16 places. only other bit of advice I can offer is that you will need to make sure you label and index ALL parts that you pull from the head (i.e. push rods, head bolts, etc.) Might not be a bad idea to have a second person help with lifting and replacing the head to avoid scratching the head gasket surface.||||reg||1
Z||000002||fryecar||01-12-2000||12:28 PM||||Thanks. Had any problems with your clutch? I have over 200K on my 2m4.... 3rd clutch!!<BR>Other than that it has been a reliable ride.||||reg||1
Z||000003||dogtired||01-12-2000||12:34 PM||||I see by your profile you have been around a few months and this is your first post!<BR>WELCOME!<BR>All these folks here think I am just crude and rude?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> Well I am,  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> but can be friendly!<BR>Pull your Speedo up and swim cap down and dive right in!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>Heads are fairly straight foreward, Depending on mileage or other suspinsions, it would be great idea to take head in for crack check? <BR>Good Luck and keep us posted, If we can't help, we like to make fun  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||6
Z||000004||DRH||01-12-2000||01:15 PM||||Welcome to the Forum.<P>If the motor has 200k it might be a good time for a total rebuild. Definitely have the head checked for cracks.<P>I'm sure it wouldn't be hard to find cars (not just Fieros) on their 3rd clutch with a lot less than 200k!||||reg||1
Z||000005||fryecar||01-12-2000||01:17 PM||||Thanks, I'v read your posts before. I'll try to be a little more open to the forum here in the future. My computer is down at home and I only get a few moments during the day while I'm at work.....  ||||reg||1
Z||000006||2birds||01-11-2000||09:42 PM||||My first two clutches started slipping after around 60,000 miles on each one.  I'm pretty rough on it, though.  (V-6/5-speed) ||||reg||1
